<title>JAPAN: Sony shares fall on stronger yen.</title>
<headline>Sony shares fall on stronger yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sony Corp declined on the Tokyo Stock Exchange on Monday morning as the stronger yen encouraged small-lot selling of the major electronics exporter, dealers said.</p>
<p>As of 0134 GMT, Sony's shares were down 70 yen at 9,880 yen.</p>
